@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Yuki.8
[PrintTextModified Text:无论堆砌怎样的辞藻，<br>那些可憎的记忆也不会消失。|#CommonBad13_Yuki002| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

