[PrintTextModified Text:我已经受够了。|#CommonBad13_Yuki003| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Yuki.19
[PrintTextModified Text:但是呢……希罗，艾玛。<br>我很感谢你们。|#CommonBad13_Yuki004| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小雪微微一笑。|#CommonBad13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:笑容很美。<br>但那溢出的愤怒与憎恶，却让我脊背发凉。|#CommonBad13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Yuki.12
[PrintTextModified Text:是你们的魔力，<br>让我有办法做到，以前无法做到的事情。|#CommonBad13_Yuki005| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小雪缓缓张开双臂，仰望天空。<br>仿佛在宣告神谕一般，超然地编织着话语。|#CommonBad13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Yuki.12
